        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Anthony Davis, Fergie\n- Companies: Visual Concepts\n- Products: NBA 2K16, \"L.A. Love (La La)\"\n- Events: 2012 Summer Olympics\n- Topics: video game cover athletes, video game soundtracks\n\nFacts:\n- Anthony Davis won a gold medal at the 2012 Summer Olympics while playing for the United States men's basketball team.\n- Visual Concepts developed NBA 2K16.\n- Fergie's song \"L.A. Love (La La)\" appears in the main game soundtrack of NBA 2K16.\n- Anthony Davis was the cover athlete for the main edition of NBA 2K16.",
